  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of this project is to provide food security assistance to vulnerable communities affected by food insecurity. This WFP project ensure food access to people affected by drought and violence. The project provides humanitarian assistance to 35,445 people, including 7,089 women,  7,443 men, 17,014 children, and including 2,481 persons with disabilities.</narrative>
